  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5mDLGGS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"434\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">恐怖生物與首領</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">為你的Minecraft世界添加恐怖實體與新首領，並附帶新武器與工具。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#008000;font-size:18px\">現需GeckoLib模組 <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#169179\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組添加具有特殊能力的恐怖生物與首領，擊敗後將掉落特殊武器與工具。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#169179\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">首領需透過召喚儀式喚醒，必須收集材料並製作召喚平台</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nk59jtR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1486\" height=\"1050\"></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>部分實體展示：</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4NAVU7h.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"461\" height=\"307\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5sveknp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"494\" height=\"298\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5maQtCt.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"511\" height=\"308\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VXlhjuh.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"418\" height=\"252\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/db9xyrd.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\" height=\"283\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/57SwZUt.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"487\" height=\"294\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pHgPeT6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"364\" height=\"219\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dDPlvzJ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"197\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STdfUXd.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"257\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FeWmza4.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"236\" height=\"142\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5dukYS.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"274\" height=\"165\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jXdsFXI.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"166\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rZu_1yNEI8o?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可自由用於模組包，但請標註原作者。建議附上本論壇文章連結。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>- 材質與模型由ALe96LN製作</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 音效由ALe96LN編輯</strong></p>",
